      "id": "claim_259e555acea04e3b86900a605db49116",
      "statement": "The `ml4t.diagnostic.reporting` package is a generic `BaseResult` rendering system whose factory supports HTML, JSON, and Markdown through import-time renderer registration, and it raises `ValueError` when a requested format has no registered generator.",
